# Repo-wide ignores only.
# Stack-specific rules live next to their tool:
#   backend/.gitignore   — Python / Django
#   frontend/.gitignore  — Node / Vite / Vue

### Secrets ###
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

### Logs ###
*.log

### Dependencies ###
# Safety net — each workspace also ignores its own.
node_modules/

### Editors ###
.idea/
*.swp
*.sw?

### OS ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

.vscode/